{"3932860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project sync", "steam_appid": 3932860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Sync is a high-octane, sc-fi arena shooter that revitalizes the classic genre for a new generation. Set aboard the Mars-bound starship Aurora, players are thrust into a state-of-the-art combat simulation to prepare for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932860/extras/2c4786f1402b2791729b3be80e46a072.avif?t=1781090733\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932860/extras_big/2c4786f1402b2791729b3be80e46a072.avif?t=1781090733 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure, Skill-Based Combat</strong> This is a return to pure, competitive FPS action. Victory is determined by skill, not by loadouts or perks. Master lightning-fast movement, including double jumps and tactical slides, to outmaneuver your opponents. The balanced sandbox of powerful sci-fi weapons and game-changing power-ups ensures that every encounter is a fresh test of your reflexes and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Multiple Game Modes</strong> Dive into a variety of competitive modes designed for endless replayability:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Deathmatch &amp; Team Deathmatch:</strong> The ultimate test of raw aiming skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way: Online &amp; Offline</strong> Challenge players from around the world in our dedicated online multiplayer. Or, hone your skills offline against highly customizable AI bots. For a classic couch gaming experience, battle it out with friends in up to 4-player local split-screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932860/extras/3f2130d4166315f029ca4049472acace.avif?t=1781090733\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932860/extras_big/3f2130d4166315f029ca4049472acace.avif?t=1781090733 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Sync is a high-octane, sc-fi arena shooter that revitalizes the classic genre for a new generation. Set aboard the Mars-bound starship Aurora, players are thrust into a state-of-the-art combat simulation to prepare for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932860/extras/2c4786f1402b2791729b3be80e46a072.avif?t=1781090733\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932860/extras_big/2c4786f1402b2791729b3be80e46a072.avif?t=1781090733 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure, Skill-Based Combat</strong> This is a return to pure, competitive FPS action. Victory is determined by skill, not by loadouts or perks. Master lightning-fast movement, including double jumps and tactical slides, to outmaneuver your opponents. The balanced sandbox of powerful sci-fi weapons and game-changing power-ups ensures that every encounter is a fresh test of your reflexes and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Multiple Game Modes</strong> Dive into a variety of competitive modes designed for endless replayability:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Deathmatch &amp; Team Deathmatch:</strong> The ultimate test of raw aiming skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way: Online &amp; Offline</strong> Challenge players from around the world in our dedicated online multiplayer. Or, hone your skills offline against highly customizable AI bots. For a classic couch gaming experience, battle it out with friends in up to 4-player local split-screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932860/extras/3f2130d4166315f029ca4049472acace.avif?t=1781090733\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932860/extras_big/3f2130d4166315f029ca4049472acace.avif?t=1781090733 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Experience a new generation of sci-fi arena FPS. Project Sync delivers pure, skill-based combat in fast-paced Martian arenas. Master tactical counter-play across multiple online modes, challenge intelligent AI bots offline, or battle friends in local split-screen. No loadouts, just pure skill.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932860/427fae46f34cb455977cd9743632b9c21ce9db83/header.jpg?t=1781090733", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932860/a4dadffce0f9ce4846e6f5d3c2bc609fc4ff382d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781090733", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932860/a4dadffce0f9ce4846e6f5d3c2bc609fc4ff382d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781090733", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4690 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</